  <section>
    <h3>Key points:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Only use NHS England approved tools.</strong></li>
      <li>This policy applies to ALL user-centred design staff (permanent, contractor, agency or Scheme of Work) who work on any NHS services.</li>
      <li><strong>Never enter personal, personal identifiable data, or business critical information into any AI tool. </strong>This ensures compliance with IT use policies, engineering standards, accessibility requirements, and enterprise guidelines.</li>
      <li>Access to generative AI websites is restricted on corporate NHSE machines (<a href="https://nhs.sharepoint.com/sites/CIG/SiteAssets/SitePages/Home/20251216-Generative-AI-Guidance-v1.0.pdf" target="_blank">view acceptable use policy</a>), with the exception of Copilot.<br>You <i>may</i> override the “AI - Site Access Request” warning, however you accept the principles and terms of usage.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

